abstract: >-
  The 2026 hourly wage each of California's 58 counties pays an IHSS Individual
  Provider (an in-home caregiver funded through the Medi-Cal In-Home Supportive
  Services program), as approved by the California Department of Social Services.
  These are government program wages, not private-pay home-care agency rates and
  not assisted-living or memory-care prices. Every figure is fetched live from
  the CDSS workbook by a committed standard-library script.
